    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Create one concise investment-focused digest for {{ $('Stock') }} from articles in 2025-01-01 to 2025-03-31.\n\n```table\ntitle: {{ $('News Retrieval - SQL').item.title }}\npublishedDate: {{ $('News Retrieval - SQL').item.publishedDate }}\ncategory: {{ $('News Retrieval - SQL').item.category }}\nsummary: {{ $('News Row Summary').item.output }}\n```\n\nReturn sections: Key Signals, Risks, and Visual Priorities.",
